  "boundary": "The authenticated BuffData reader directly orders members 2-4 after the existing first collection. The scalar reuses the pinned BlackboardDouble profile. The next helper reads signed count and copies count*4 contiguous bytes without element headers. AttributeModifierData consumes FF or header2, a nullable reference array and a required byte; selected AttributeModifier elements consume FF or header4, three DWORDs and BlackboardDouble. Exact static MethodSpec/type joins and full selected formatter/read/helper windows support structural-only framing. Array provider selection remains conditional; no live provider choice, field meaning, modifier behavior, full refill/error parity, suffix-anchor ownership or whole-BuffData EOF is claimed."
